# "Counter target noncreature spell": Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature spell, is not a legal target (CR 115.1) so Force of
# Negation is refused against it, with a Brainstorm in Bot1's hand to pay the alternative cost. It resolves; Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt cast next is the control, and Force of Negation counters and exiles it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Force of Negation
Brainstorm
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
